      "blurb": "Elite krogan combat specialist",
      "publicNotes": "<p>A krogan warrior who has survived long enough to be genuinely dangerous-which means they have survived things that killed most of their contemporaries. Krogan warriors become more effective as they take damage; their redundant biology and combat adrenaline response makes them progressively harder to stop the more hurt they are.</p><p><strong>Krogan Fortitude:</strong> Fast healing 2 while below half HP.</p><p><strong>Blood Rage:</strong> When reduced below half HP, gains 8 temporary HP and deals +1d6 damage on melee Strikes until end of next turn.</p><p><strong>Headbutt:</strong> On a critical hit, target must succeed DC 22 Fortitude or be stunned 1.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 50 Shield HP. Recharges 15 HP per turn.</p>",
